OL,3,ABlack Friday and tax return scams -
OL,4,Adon't fall for these
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis month's Black Friday and the tax
OL,7,Freturn deadline at the end of January
OL,8,Fare both opportunities for fraudsters
OL,9,Fto scam you.
OL,11,FThat's because people are more likely
OL,12,Fto expect emails, texts and other
OL,13,Fcorrespondence at this time of year.
OL,15,FFraudsters will use the dates to
OL,16,Fimpersonate genuine organisations and
OL,17,Fretailers by pushing victims towards
OL,18,Ffake websites to steal personal
OL,19,Finformation.
OL,21,FHere's how to spot a scam and how you
OL,22,Fcan avoid being caught out.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
